S:collected from Jim French, Moree, NSW
S:collected by Chris Sullivan
Z:transcribed by Jeff Lawrie
N:Rita Croaker's Step Tune is another version of this tune in D major.
H:Jim said that he learned this tune from Cecil Maddern at Caroona, when step dancing was still popular in the 1920s.
